#. i18n: file: shellOptions.ui:90
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, cbRealtime)
#: rc.cpp:3
msgid ""
"<qt>Select whether realtime scheduling should be enabled for the "
"application. The scheduler governs which process will run and which will "
"have to wait. Two schedulers are available:\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li><em>Normal:</em> This is the standard, timesharing scheduler. It will "
"divide fairly the available processing time between all processes.</li>\n"
"<li><em>Realtime:</em>This scheduler will run your application uninterrupted "
"until it gives up the processor. This can be dangerous. An application that "
"does not give up the processor might hang the system. You need root's "
"password to use the scheduler.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file: shellOptions.ui:93
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, cbRealtime)
#: rc.cpp:11
msgid "Run with realtime &scheduling"
msgstr "Wuwjesć po &prawočasowej protyce"

#. i18n: file: shellOptions.ui:111
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, lbUsername)
#. i18n: file: shellOptions.ui:242
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, leUsername)
#: rc.cpp:14 rc.cpp:47
msgid "Enter the user you want to run the application as here."
msgstr "Zapodajće mjeno wužiwarja, pod kotrymž ma so aplikacija wuwjesć."

#. i18n: file: shellOptions.ui:114
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, lbUsername)
#: rc.cpp:17
msgid "User&name:"
msgstr "Mjeno &wužiwarja:"

#. i18n: file: shellOptions.ui:135
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, lePassword)
#. i18n: file: shellOptions.ui:156
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, lbPassword)
#: rc.cpp:20 rc.cpp:23
msgid "Enter the password here for the user you specified above."
msgstr "Zapodajće škitne hesło za horjeka zapodate mjeno wužiwarja."

#. i18n: file: shellOptions.ui:159
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, lbPassword)
#: rc.cpp:26
msgid "Pass&word:"
msgstr "Škitne &hesło:"

#. i18n: file: shellOptions.ui:169
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, cbRunInTerminal)
#: rc.cpp:29
msgid ""
"Check this option if the application you want to run is a text mode "
"application. The application will then be run in a terminal emulator window."
msgstr ""
"Hóčkujće tutu opciju, hdyž dźěła aplikacija w tekstowym modusu. Wona so "
"potom w terminalu wuwjedźe."

#. i18n: file: shellOptions.ui:172
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, cbRunInTerminal)
#: rc.cpp:32
msgid "Run in &terminal window"
msgstr "W &terminalu wuwjesć"

#. i18n: file: shellOptions.ui:190
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel1)
#. i18n: file: shellOptions.ui:260
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, lbLowPriority)
#. i18n: file: shellOptions.ui:273
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, lbHighPriority)
#. i18n: file: shellOptions.ui:297
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QSlider, slPriority)
#: rc.cpp:35 rc.cpp:50 rc.cpp:56 rc.cpp:62
msgid ""
"The priority that the command will be run with can be set here. From left to "
"right, it goes from low to high. The center position is the default value. "
"For priorities higher than the default, you will need to provide the root "
"password."
msgstr ""
"Priorita, z kotrejž so přikaz wuwjedźe, hodźi so tu postajić. Nalěwo je "
"najniša priorita, naprawo najwjetša. Centralna pozicija je standard. Za "
"wjetšu hač standardowu prioritu dyrbiće administratorowe hesło zapodać."

#. i18n: file: shellOptions.ui:193
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel1)
#: rc.cpp:38
msgid "&Priority:"
msgstr "&Priorita:"

#. i18n: file: shellOptions.ui:221
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, cbPriority)
#: rc.cpp:41
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to run the application with a different "
"priority. A higher priority tells the operating system to give more "
"processing time to your application."
msgstr ""
"Hójčkujće tu, hdyž chceće aplikaciju z hinajšej prioritu wuwjesć. Wjetša "
"priorita praji systemej, zo ma Wašej aplikaciji wjace procesoroweho časa k "
"dispoziciji stajić."

#. i18n: file: shellOptions.ui:224
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, cbPriority)
#: rc.cpp:44
msgid "Run with a &different priority"
msgstr "Wuwjesć z &hinašej prioritu"

#. i18n: file: shellOptions.ui:263
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, lbLowPriority)
#: rc.cpp:53
msgid "Low"
msgstr "Niska"

#. i18n: file: shellOptions.ui:276
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, lbHighPriority)
#: rc.cpp:59
msgid "High"
msgstr "Wulka"

#. i18n: file: shellOptions.ui:312
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, cbRunAsOther)
#: rc.cpp:65
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to run the application with a different user "
"id. Every process has a user id associated with it. This id code determines "
"file access and other permissions. The password of the user is required to "
"do this."
msgstr ""
"Hóčkujće tu, hdyž ma so aplikacija pod hinašim wužiwarskim mjenom wuwjesć. "
"Kóždy proces běži pod někajkim wužiwarjom; wot toho wotwisuje přistup a "
"druhe prawa. Škitne hesło wužiwarja je za to trěbne."

#. i18n: file: shellOptions.ui:315
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, cbRunAsOther)
#: rc.cpp:68
msgid "Run as a different &user"
msgstr "Pod hinašim &wužiwarjom wuwjesć"

#: shellrunner.cpp:69
#, kde-format
msgid "Run %1"
msgstr "%1 wuwjesć"
